ific cleaning duties for washing area", "6232": "instruction on caring for nuns studying Vinaya", "6266": "rules on painting non-sentient decorative images", "6301": "verse passage detailing ornamentation of the stūpa", "6307": "prose list enumerating the four banners from preceding verse"}}